<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1TI" style="id">Dai-Chin: Bible Translation 1st Edition</book>
  <para style="ide">Unicode (UTF-8)</para>
  <para style="h">1 Timoti</para>
  <para style="toc1">TIMOTIA veia Pawluha Cayuk Akcüknak</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Timoti</para>
  <para style="toc3">1Tim</para>
  <para style="mt1">TIMOTIA</para>
  <para style="mt2">Veia Pawluha Cayuk Akcüknak</para>
  <para style="imt">Pyenhlüma</para>
  <para style="ip">Timoti cun a pa Krik ja a nu Judah nghnumia cakpaa kya lü Asah Maina üngka khritjan cawngpyanga kyaki. Ani cun Pawluha missionary khut üng ngpüi lü kpüikpakia kyaki. Timotia vei Pawluha cayuk akcük hin a mawngma kthum am sängeiki ni.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ca akcük hin naw Sangcim k'uma akhye mtheinak jah mcäiki. Ahina mtheinak hin Judahe ja Judah am nikiea cungaih cun jah mdawn lü khyu käh lak ja eiawk jeihnak ja ngthupkia ksingkhyapnak am küikyannak mi yah theiki ti ja khawmdek hin am dawkyaki ni tia jumnake cän jah mcäiki. Ca hin üng Sangcima hjawkhahnak ja upnaka mawng mcuhmthehnak pi ngpüi lü Sangcim ngvaie ja khüikhawmkiea ngneisak yuk sihki. Akpäihnaka ihawkba Jesuh Khritawa mpya akdawa thawn lü jumeiki khyang päe veia a mta cun Timoti üng mthehki.</para>
  <para style="iot">Amawng Ktawie</para>
  <para style="io1">Pyenhlüma <char style="ior">(<ref loc="1TI 1:1-2">1:1-2</ref>) </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Sangcima phäh mcäinak ja Sangcim ngvaie <char style="ior">(<ref loc="1TI 1:3-3:16">1:3—3:16</ref>) </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Timotia khut a mcuhmthehnaka mawnge <char style="ior">(<ref loc="1TI 4:1-6:21">4:1—6:21</ref>) </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1TI 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 1:1"/>Mi äpeia Khritaw Jesuh ja mi küikyan Bawi Pamhnama khü, Khritaw Jesuha ngsä Pawluh üngkhyüh ni —<verse eid="1TI 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 1:2"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 16:1">Ngs 16:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Jumnak üng ka ca kcang Timotia veia: Mi Pa Pamhnam ja mi Bawipa Khritaw Jesuh naw bäkhäknak, mpyenmseinak ja dimdeihnak ning pe se.<verse eid="1TI 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mcuhmthehnak akhye jah mcäinak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 1:3"/>Maketawnih hne da ka ceh üng ka ning cüka kba Ephet mlüha na awma vai ka hlüeiki. Khyang avang naw akhye mcuhmthehnake ami jah mthei cän jah him kawm ti.<verse eid="1TI 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 1:4"/>Jumeinak üng mi ksinga Pamhnama bü cun am khüi u lü jah ngcuhngkaihsak khai khuikam ja pakhui tähnake cän ami jah hawih vaia jah mtheh bä.<verse eid="1TI 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 1:5"/>Ahin ka tinak hlü ta, mlung angcim, ngcimkia ksingnak ja jumeinak kcange üngkhyüh lawkia mhläkphyanak a ve law vaia ni.<verse eid="1TI 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 1:6"/>Khyang avange cun ahine üngkhyüh nglat u lü amdanga ngthähnak am ami lam mkhyühki he.<verse eid="1TI 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 1:7"/>Pamhnama thum jah mthei hlü u lüpi, mkhühüpnak üng a mi pyena mawnge ja amimäta ngthukhyü pi am ksing u.<verse eid="1TI 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 1:8"/>Thum cun sumeinak vai üng mi sumei cun dawki tia mi ksingkie.<verse eid="1TI 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 1:9"/>Acuna thume cun khyang kdawa phäh am kya, lüpi thum lümkanki he, khyangksee, Pamhnam am ksing lü mkhyekatkie, hjawkkhah ning ja Ngmüimkhya lam am ksingkie, ami nupa hnimki he ja khyang hnimki he,<verse eid="1TI 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 1:10"/>ami vecawh am dawki he, hüipawmkie, khyang pinmankie, hleihlak lü cangkia mcuhmthehnak kpet lü akhyea saksi jah pekie ja akdaw ngthei ngkhawngnak üng ngsukhyekie ni.<verse eid="1TI 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 1:11"/>Acuna mtheinak cun Pamhnama hlüngtainak ja jodawnak cun thangkdaw üngkhyüh kya lü acun hin sang khaia kei üng a na ap ni.<verse eid="1TI 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pamhnama mpyeneinaka phäh jeeinak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 1:12"/>Ka khüibinak üng ngjuktha na pekia mi Bawipa Khritaw Jesuh cun ka jenaki. Ania khut bi khaia ka lawingkawihkia ngai lü a na mcawna phäh ka jenak ni.<verse eid="1TI 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 1:13"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 8:3">Ngs 8:3</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 9:4">9:4</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 9:5">5</ref></char>
    </note>Ahlana ani cun mkhuimkha lü ksekha na lü am adawa mawng ka pyen khawi kyawki. I ka pawh käh ksing lü jumnak am tak ham üngpi Pamhnam naw na mpyeneiki.<verse eid="1TI 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 1:14"/>Khritaw Jesuh üng mi yümmatnaka kyaki mhläkphyanak ja jumnak cun kei üng na pe lü mi Bawipa naw a bäkhäknak akda keia khana buiki. <verse eid="1TI 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 1:15"/>Khritaw Jesuh khawmdeka a law hin mkhyeki he jah küikyan khaia lawki ti hin dokham lü jum kcang vai ti cun akcang pyena kyaki. Kei cun ami ksunga akse säih ni, <verse eid="1TI 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 1:16"/>lüpi Pamhnam naw kei a na mpyenei hin Khritaw Jesuha mlung saünak kei üng mdanki. Akse säiha mkhyeki he hnua jumei law u lü sak ngsäi xünnak ami yah vaia msuimcäpnaka ka kyaki. <verse eid="1TI 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 1:17"/>Pamhnam mat däka kyaki, am thi thei lü am hmuh theia kyaki angsäia sangpuxanga thawnki ania veia hlüngtainak ja mküimtonak am angläta ve se! Amen.<verse eid="1TI 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 1:18"/>Ka ca Timoti aw, ahina ngthupet cun nang üng ka ning ap ni, a hin cun ajana sahmae naw ami pyen kawia ngthukhyüa kyaki ni. Acäna ngthukhyüe cän akdawa na ngtukahnak vaia likcima jah sumei lü, <verse eid="1TI 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 1:19"/>na jumnak kcüng lü na cungaihnak pi vai kawm. Khyang avang naw ami ngcungihnak käh ngai u lü ami jumeinak kpyakie ni.<verse eid="1TI 1:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 1:20"/>Acune ksunga Himenias ja Aleksanda cun Khawyama johita k'uma jah ap lü ka jah mkhuimkha ni; ahin naw Pamhnam ami hmakatsak ami hawih vaia jah mthei khai ni.<verse eid="1TI 1:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1TI 2"/>
  <para style="s">Sangcima hjawkhahnak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 2:1"/>Acunakyase, akcüka, täsamnak, ktaiyünak, nghuinak ja jenak cun khyang avana phäha Pamhnama vei nami pawh vaia ning jah mtheh veng.<verse eid="1TI 2:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 2:2"/>Sangpuxang He ja ana takie cun dim’ye lü akdima Pamhnam leisawng lü akdawa ami ngneisaknak vaia phäha ni. <verse eid="1TI 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 2:3"/>Ahin hin daw lü mi küikyan Bawi Pamhnam jesaki ni, <verse eid="1TI 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 2:4"/>ani naw khyang naküt küikyannak yah lü ngthungtak ami ksing vai hlüei ve. <verse eid="1TI 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 2:5"/>Pamhnam mat ve lü Pamhnam ja nghngicim atänga jah lawpüiki khyang ta Khritaw Jesuh ni, <verse eid="1TI 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 2:6"/>ani cun nghngicim avan jah thawngkhyah vaia lawki. Pamhnam naw khyang naküt akcün kdaw üng küikyannak a yah vaia ahin cun saksi ni, <verse eid="1TI 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 2:7"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TI 1:11">2Tim 1:11</ref></char></note> Acunakyase, kei cun khyangmjükcee jah mthei lü ngsäa kba ngthungtak ja jumeinaka mawng cun ka sang khaia a na tüih ni. Ka hlei am pyen ngü akcang ni ka pyen!<verse eid="1TI 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 2:8"/>Sangcima hjawkhahnak üng kpamie, Pamhnam ümnakie naw ngcuhngkaihnak ja mlungsonak käh ta lü ami kut khana jah säng u lü ami ktaiyü vai hlüei veng. <verse eid="1TI 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 2:9"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 3:3">1Pit 3:3</ref></char></note>Nghnumie pi aphu küi suisake, lusam pitpyangnak, xüi bilawhnak, suisak akdawa suiawi lü mlung mhnem lü käh nami nukhyap vai ka hlüeiki ni, <verse eid="1TI 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 2:10"/>lüpi Pamhnam ka jumki tikia nghnumi cun naw akdaw bilo yah khai. <verse eid="1TI 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 2:11"/>Nghnumie naw käh khikheh lü mlung mhnemnak am ngthei u se. <verse eid="1TI 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 2:12"/>Nghnumie cun kpamiea khana ana ta lü jah mtheimkhawng khaia am täng veng, lüpi amimi cun hniphnawi yah khaie ni. <verse eid="1TI 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 2:13"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:13: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:7">Gen 2:7</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:21">Gen 2:21</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 2:22">22</ref></char></note>Adam cun mhnün ma lü acun käna Evah a mhnün ni. <verse eid="1TI 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 2:14"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 3:1-6">Gen 3:1-6</ref></char></note>Adam cun hlawhlepnak am kham lü Nghnumi va hlawhlepnak kham lü Pamhnama thum pi lümkanki.<verse eid="1TI 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 2:15"/>Nghnumi cun a caa phäh küikyannak yah khai,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:15: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">cana ta lü küikyannak yah khai; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">am ani üng</char><char style="fq" closed="false">ca a canaka phäh küikyannak yah khai.</char></note> jummeinak, mhläkphyanak ja ngcimcaihnak cun mlung mhnemnak am a mtunei<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:15 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">a mtunei üng</char><char style="ft" closed="false">am ani üng</char><char style="fq" closed="false">ami mtunei u üng.</char></note> üng ni.<verse eid="1TI 2:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1TI 3"/>
  <para style="s">Sangcim ngvaie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 3:1"/>Akcang pyen ta: Kpami mat naw sangcim üng ngvai a bi hlü hin akdaw säiha ngaihnak ni.<verse eid="1TI 3:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 3:2"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="TIT 1:6-9">Tit 1:6-9</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Sangcim ngvai cun kbäüeinak am ve yah: a khyu mat däk ve yah khai, <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:2: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">khyu mat la yah khai </char><char style="ft" closed="false">am ani üng</char><char style="fq" closed="false">ahun däk ca la yah khai.</char></note>a mlung mhnemki, amät nängeiki, dawkyaki, a ima khin khina theiki, mtheinak pi pawh theiki,<verse eid="1TI 3:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 3:3"/>ju käh mpyüiki, ngtun käh pawhki, hniphnawiki, dim’ye lü ngui pi käh jawng na yah khai,<verse eid="1TI 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 3:4"/>ani cun amäta imkyawng up khawh lü a canae naw leisawng u lü a mtheh pi ngja yah khaie. <verse eid="1TI 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 3:5"/>Amäta imkyawng up vai am ksingki naw ihawkba Pamhnama sangcim cun msümcei khai ni? <verse eid="1TI 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 3:6"/>Jumeinak üng ngkhäng lü käh awhcah yah khai, Khawyai cun awhcah lü mkatnak a yaha kba käh thawn khai ni. <verse eid="1TI 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 3:7"/>Ani cun sangcim k'uma am veki khyange naw ami leisawng üngva Khawyaia mannak hlü üng lät lü a jo pi am se khai ni.<verse eid="1TI 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sangcim k'uma khüikie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 3:8"/>Sangcim k'uma khüikie pi ngneisak daw lü ngcimcaihki; nguia hnu käh läk lü ju pi käh mpyüihmah yah khai; <verse eid="1TI 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 3:9"/>amimi naw mdana ngthungtak cun ksingkhyapnak kcang am kcüng yah khaie ni. <verse eid="1TI 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 3:10"/>Akcüka sükcetnak kham u lü acun ami lät üng khüi bi yah khaie. <verse eid="1TI 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 3:11"/>Ami khyue<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:11: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ami khyue; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">am ani üng </char><char style="fq" closed="false">jah kueiki nghnumie.</char></note> pi ami ngneisak daw lü cawkcek käh pawh lü anaküt üng thephya lü mlung mhnemkiea kya yah khaie ni.<verse eid="1TI 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 3:12"/>Sangcim üng khüiki cun a khyu mat däk ve yah khai, <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:12: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">khyu mat la yah khai </char><char style="ft" closed="false">am ani üng</char><char style="fq" closed="false">ahun däk ca la yah khai.</char></note>a canae ja a imkyawng cun akdawa jah up khawh yah khai.<verse eid="1TI 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 3:13"/>Sangcim k'uma khüikie cun akdawa ngdüi tho lü Khritaw Jesuh jumeinaka mawng pi ling lü pyen khawh yah khai.<verse eid="1TI 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ngthupki akdäm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 3:14"/>Ahina ca ka yuk lawa kba, säng säng se nami veia law lü ning jah hmu khaia äpei veng. <verse eid="1TI 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 3:15"/>Lüpi ka cü üngta ahina ca naw ngthungtak däh lü ktunga kyakia Pamhnama imbung ja xüngseikia Pamhnama sangcim k'uma ihawkba vecawh vai ti cun ning jah ksingsak khai ni.<verse eid="1TI 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 3:16"/>Mi hjawkkhah ning ihlawka ngthup lü dämki ti cun u naw pi am kpet khawh:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">Ani cun nghngicima kba ngdang law lü</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1TI 3:16">akcün akha üng Ngmüimkhya naw a ngdansak,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:16: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">akcün akha üng Ngmüimkhya naw a ngdansak; </char><char style="fq" closed="false">am ani üng </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ngmüimkhya luplei üng akcün akha üng ngdang lawki.</char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1TI 3:16">khankhawngsä he naw hmukie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">ani cun khyangmjüea veia kpyaü hükie,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1TI 3:16">khawmdek lum üng jumei u lü</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1TI 3:16">khankhawa kai beki ni.<verse eid="1TI 3:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1TI 4"/>
  <para style="s">Akhye jah mtheikie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 4:1"/>Ngmüimkhya naw angsinga a pyen ta law khaia kcüne üng khyang avange naw jumnak hawih u lü ngmüimkhya k’hleie jah kcang na u lü khawyaiea mtheimthange cun läklam law khaie ni.<verse eid="1TI 4:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 4:2"/>Hleihlakiea tuivetnak am ahina ngtheinak cun ngthang hüki, ami ksingkhyapnake thi lü mthi ngling naw jah uiawngki. <verse eid="1TI 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 4:3"/>Acuna khyange naw akhyesawh calaknak ja eiawk avang käh ei vaia jah mtheikie. Jenak mtheh lü ktaiyü käna ei vaia Pamhnam naw acuna eiawk cun a mhnünmceng ni, acun hin ngthungtak ksing lawki he ja jumeikiea phäh ni. <verse eid="1TI 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 4:4"/>Pamhnama mhnünmceng naküt hin dawkia kyase mah vai i am ve, lüpi jenak mtheh lü ktaiyünak am dokham vai ni, <verse eid="1TI 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 4:5"/>isetiakyaküng Pamhnama ngthu ja ktaiyünak cun Pamhnam naw dokhameiki ni.<verse eid="1TI 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Khritaw Jesuha mpya kdaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 4:6"/>Namät naw ngmüimkhya lama jumeinak ngthu eiaw lü cangkia ngtheinak na läklam pänga kba, ahina mcuhmthehnake jumeikie üng na jah pet üng nang cun Khritaw Jesuha mpya kdawa na kya khai. <verse eid="1TI 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 4:7"/>Pyensaka am dawki he, khuikame üngkhyüh akthuka vea. Pamhnam ksingnaka kcünsak üng na mät ngtuinglenga. <verse eid="1TI 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 4:8"/>Pumsa thületnak cun dawki ni; acun sepi, Ngmüimkhya lama thületnak hin anaküt üng daw bawki ni, isetikyaküng, ahin cun naw malam ja atuha kcün sak xawia phäh khyütam jah peki ni. <verse eid="1TI 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 4:9"/>Ahin cun cangkia pyensaka kya lü jumei lü dokham vai kunga kyaki. <verse eid="1TI 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 4:10"/>Bawngkha<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:10: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">bawngkha; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">avanga caup üng veki ta</char><char style="fq" closed="false">mtuneinak.</char></note> lü mi khüiki, isetiakyaküng, aktunga ani jumei lü avana küikyan Bawia kya lü xüngseiki Pamhnama vei mi äpeinak mi taki. <verse eid="1TI 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 4:11"/>Ahina mcuhmthehnake ja ngtheinake cän jah pea. <verse eid="1TI 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 4:12"/>Na dik hama phäh u naw pi käh ning mdihmsui se. Na pyensak, na vecawh, na mhläkphyanak, na jumeinak ja na ngcimcaihnake cun jumeikie naw a ning hjutuih vaia thawna. <verse eid="1TI 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 4:13"/>Ka law vei cäpa, khyangea veia Cangcim khehnak, ngthu sangnak ja mtheinak üng na kcün pe lü biloa.<verse eid="1TI 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 4:14"/>Na khana sahmae naw pyen u lü ngvaie naw ami kut mtaih üng Ngmüimkhyaa ning peta bänak cän am hnaläüei lü käh ve bä.<verse eid="1TI 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 4:15"/>Khyang avan naw na dämduh a ning hmuh vai ua, ahine cän jah ktha na lü ngapei kawm pi.<verse eid="1TI 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 4:16"/>Namät pi mcei lü na jah mtheinak pi mcei bä. Ahine cun msu lü pawh bä, isetiakyaküng, ahine na pawh ta ning ngjakie ja namät kung pi ning jah küikyan khai ni.<verse eid="1TI 4:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1TI 5"/>
  <para style="s">Jumeikie veia bilawh vaia mta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 5:1"/>Axüngvai kpami cän käh jah pyensa lü na pa mäia ani cun nghui na bä. Ami sak dik hamkia kpamie cän pi na benaa mäia jah vecawh püia. <verse eid="1TI 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 5:2"/>Axüngvai nghnumie pi na nua mäia jah mtheh lü ami sak diki nghnumie pi na cina mäia mlung ngcimnak üng jah mcuhmtheh bä.<verse eid="1TI 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 5:3"/>Amimät vekia hmeinue kcang cän jah leisawng bä. <verse eid="1TI 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 5:4"/>Acunsepi, a tuca vekia hmeinue akcüka ami imkyawng üng Pamhnam ami jum vaia mta ami pawh vai cun ngthei ma u lü ami nupa ja ami pupie cun jah thungkhih be kawm u, isetiakyaküng, ahin naw Pamhnam jesaki ni.<verse eid="1TI 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 5:5"/>Hmeinu amät däk ve lü bükteng khai am veki cun Pamhnam äpei lü amhnüp amthan ktaiyü lü Pamhnam üm na khawhki. <verse eid="1TI 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 5:6"/>Bawimangnak vai suikia hmeinu ta xüng kyaw lüpi thiki ni. <verse eid="1TI 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 5:7"/>U naw pi ami hmakatnak käh a jah hmuh vaia ahina mcuhmthehnake cän na jah mthei vai.<verse eid="1TI 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 5:8"/>A u pi ami kawnsang, aktunga ami mäta imkyawng üngka am büktengki ta jumeinak mah lü am jumeikie kthaka pi sexuki ni.<verse eid="1TI 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 5:9"/>A kum khyukip am khekia nghnumi cän hmeinu calang üng käh na ngpüisak vai. Acuna thea ahun däk va cei mah<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:9: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">a hun däk cei mah lü; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">am ani üng </char><char style="fq" closed="false">a kpami üng sitihki.</char></note> lü <verse eid="1TI 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 5:10"/>akdaw a bilawha phäh nglongthangki: a ca akdawa jah mdühmcahki, a ima khin dokhamki, jumeikiea phäh nemkia mtae biloki, khuikhakia khyange jah kpüi lü amät pi akdawkya biloki cun na ngpüisak vai.<verse eid="1TI 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 5:11"/>Ami sak dik hamkia hmeinue ta käh na jah ngpüisak vai; isetiakyaküng, ami cei mah be vai ami täng üng Khritaw nglatakie, <verse eid="1TI 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 5:12"/>akcüka ami pawha khyütam ami lümkana phäh mkhyekatnak pha law khai ni. <verse eid="1TI 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 5:13"/>Khyange ima cit hü u lü ami kcün päihnak khaie, acuna thea akse bawk ta, am ami pyensak vai pyen u lü khyanga am adawa mawng cingjangei khaie ni. <verse eid="1TI 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 5:14"/>Acunakyase, a sak dik hamki hmeinue cän cei mah be u lü ami imkyawng ja ami canae cun ami jah mceimsang üngva mi yee naw mi phäha akse ami pyen vai am ve. <verse eid="1TI 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 5:15"/>Hmeinu avange ta Khawyam läk khaia nglat pängkie ni.<verse eid="1TI 5:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 5:16"/>Khritjan nghnumia ima hmeinue kcang ami ve üng ani naw jah mcei lü sangcima phäha phüihkawh käh mtaih kawm, acukba akyak üngva amimät veki hmeinue cun sangcim naw jah mceimsang khai.<verse eid="1TI 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 5:17"/>Khawngmanga kba akdawa khut biki ngvaie cän, aktunga ngthu sang lü jah mtheimthangkie cun püp nghngih ngkhyengnak yahei khaiea ngkäihki ni. <verse eid="1TI 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 5:18"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:18: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 25:4">Deut 25:4</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:10">Mt 10:10</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:7">Lk 10:7</ref></char></note>Cangcim naw, “Cang lehsaka se cän a mpyawng käh kbüpa” “khüikie cän pi ngkhyengnak yah khaie ni” tia pyenki. <verse eid="1TI 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 5:19"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 17:6">Deut 17:6</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 19:15">19:15</ref></char></note>Nghngih kthuma ja acuna thea nungki saksi am ve xa lü angvai ami mkateia ngkhaw cän käh jah ngai bä. <verse eid="1TI 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 5:20"/>Mkhyekatkie cän khyang ksunga na jah ksenak üngva akcee pi kyühei khaie.<verse eid="1TI 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TI 5:21"/>Pamhnam ni, Khritaw Jesuh ja a xüa khankhawngsä hea hmaia khawkphyüm ngai lü khyang hmai käh na teng vaia hina mcuhmthehnake hin jah läklama. <verse eid="1TI 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1TI 5:22"/>Bawipaa khut pawh khaia khyange jah cuap lü ami khana na kut akjanga käh mtaih bä. Khyangea mkhye käh jah ng’yetei püi lü namät na ngcimsak vai.<verse eid="1TI 5:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1TI 5:23"/>Am na khyaih xawh xawhkia kyase tui däk käh aw lü na ei acip thei vaia capyit tui aläm pi awk sih bä.<verse eid="1TI 5:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1TI 5:24"/>Khyang avangea mkhyekatnak cun angsinga mi hmu se ami mkhye naw ngthumkhyah vaia jah cehpüi lü khyang akcea mkhyekatnak cun hnua ni mi hmuh ta. <verse eid="1TI 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1TI 5:25"/>Acukba kunga akdaw mi bilawh cun angsinga mi hmu lü am ngsing bäki cän pi am mi thup thei.<verse eid="1TI 5:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1TI 6"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 6:1"/>Mpyae naw ami mahpae cun leisawng vaia ngkäihkia ami ngaih üngva Pamhnama ngming ja kami jah mtheinak cun akse u naw pi am pyen.<verse eid="1TI 6:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 6:2"/>Khritjan mahpanakie mpyae naw ami mahpae käh jah mdihmsui u se, isetiakyaküng ami mahpae cun pi jumeikie ni. Sa lü akdaw bawka jah bi pet khaie, isetiakyaküng ami khut üngkhyüh akdaw ami yaheinak cän ami jah kphyanak jumeikie ami mahpae ni.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="1TI 6:2">Akhye mtheinak ja akcanga bawimangnake</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TI 6:2">Nang naw ahine cun sang lü na jah mthei yah khai. <verse eid="1TI 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 6:3"/>A u pi mi ngtheinak ja mi Bawipa Jesuh Khritawa ngthu kcang üng am täng lü ningsaw hngalangkia mtheinak pawki cun, <verse eid="1TI 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 6:4"/>awcahnak naw mjaw lü i pi am ksing. Ani naw a law cun am dawkia ngcuhnak ja ngvawknak hlü vai khyü nglung he ta lü ahin naw ng’eihnak, ngcuhngkaihnak, thangmsetnak, aksea ngaihnak, <verse eid="1TI 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 6:5"/>angläta ngcuh vai cun ngthungtak ami mlunga am vekia khyange ni. Ningsaw hin bawimangnak vaia amimi naw ngaikie ni.<verse eid="1TI 6:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 6:6"/>Daw ve, mi tak mi khäksak üng ningsaw naw jah bawimangsaki. <verse eid="1TI 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 6:7"/>Khawmdeka i mi law püiki ni? I am mi law püi! Khawmdek üngkhyüh i ja mi cehpüi thei? I am mi cehpüi thei! <verse eid="1TI 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 6:8"/>Acuna kyase, eiawk ja suiawi mi tak hin mimia phäh khäk ve. <verse eid="1TI 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 6:9"/>Lüpi, bawimang hlükie cun, hlawhlepnak khamei u lü angnak naw jah pinman lü akse hlükaweinak naw amimi cun pyaknak ja pyüpyehnak da jah kaihki ni. <verse eid="1TI 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 6:10"/>Ngui jawngnak hin aksekhyu naküta phungnu ni. Khyang avang cun ahin tak vai täng lü jumnak üngkhyüh akthuka cit u lü ami mlung puksetsakie ni.<verse eid="1TI 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pawluha mcäinake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 6:11"/>Acunsepi, nang Pamhnama khyang ahina ngkhawe jah hjawnga. Nang ta ngsungpyunnak, Pamhnam ksingnak, jumeinak, mhläkphyanak, khameinak ja hniphnawinak na tak vaia mtunei bä. <verse eid="1TI 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 6:12"/>Jumeinak üng na khyaih khawha dawng lü angläta xünnak cän yaha, saksi khawhah maa na tak jumnak ja Pamhnam naw ahina sak aning khü üng angkhänga na ng’anei cän ni.<verse eid="1TI 6:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 6:13"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 18:37">Jn 18:37</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Anaküt üng xünnak pekia Pamhnam hmai ma ja Pontas Pilat maa jumnak angkhänga ng’aneiki Khritaw Jesuha maa ngthu ka ning pet ta,<verse eid="1TI 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 6:14"/>Mi Bawipa Jesuh Khritaw ponak law Mhnüp vei cäpa sitih lü na bi vai jah kcüngei lü jah läklam kawm pi. <verse eid="1TI 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 6:15"/>Bawiea Bawipa, sangpuxangea Sangpuxang, a jodaw lü Suki mat däk Pamhnam kcün a kha üng a ponak vai cun ngdang law khai.<verse eid="1TI 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 6:16"/>Ani däk va am thi thei lü u naw pi am a k’et khawha akvai üng veki. U naw pi am hmu thei, u naw pi am hmu khawi. Angläta johit ja leisawngnak a veia ve se! Amen.<verse eid="1TI 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 6:17"/>Hina kcünsak üng bawimangkie cän, ami kcünsak üng käh awhcah lü am ngkhängkia bawimangnak üng äpeinak käh ta lü anaküt mi jekyainak vaia jah peki Pamhnama vei äpeinak ami tak vaia jah mtheha. <verse eid="1TI 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 6:18"/>Ami tak cun käh kpamei lü akce üngpi jah yet lü akdaw lama bawimang u lü akdaw ami bilawh vaia jah mtheha. <verse eid="1TI 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 6:19"/>Ahina tuilam üng ni malama ngkhängkia bawimangnak cun mkhämei khaie ni. Acun üngva amimi naw xünnak akcang cun yahei khaie.<verse eid="1TI 6:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 6:20"/>Timoti aw, na mcei vaia ning ap cän akdawa säma. Amdang pyensake ja khyang avange naw “Ksingkhyapnak” ami tia am käh ngtähkia ngcuhngkaihnake cän jah hjawng bä. <verse eid="1TI 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TI 6:21"/>Avang he naw acun kami taki ti u lü acuna phäh jumnak lam mkhyühki he. Pamhnama bäkhäknak nami vana khana ve se.<verse eid="1TI 6:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 6"/>
</usx>
